 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ST2A1_HUMAN Reviewed; 285 AA.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION: Sulfotransferase that utilizes 3&apos;-phospho-5&apos;-adenylylsulfate (PAPS) as sulfonate donor to catalyze the sulfonation ofsteroids and bile acids in the liver and adrenal glands.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=3&apos;-phosphoadenylyl sulfate + glycolithocholate =adenosine 3&apos;,5&apos;-bisphosphate + H(+) + sulfoglycolithocholate;Xref=Rhea:RHEA:10908, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:58339,ChEBI:CHEBI:58343, ChEBI:CHEBI:60007, ChEBI:CHEBI:60008;EC=2.8.2.14;CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=3&apos;-phosphoadenylyl sulfate + taurolithocholate =adenosine 3&apos;,5&apos;-bisphosphate + H(+) + taurolithocholate sulfate;Xref=Rhea:RHEA:14013, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:17179,ChEBI:CHEBI:58301, ChEBI:CHEBI:58339, ChEBI:CHEBI:58343;EC=2.8.2.14;SUBUNIT: Homodimer. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:10854859,ECO:0000269|PubMed:11988089, ECO:0000269|PubMed:14573603}.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasm.TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Liver, adrenal and at lower level in thekidney. Is present in human fetus in higher level in the adrenalthan the liver and the kidney.PTM: The N-terminus is blocked.MISCELLANEOUS: Estrogens present in maternal circulation ispredominantly derived from fetal dehydroepiandosterone sulfatewhich is hydrolyzed and metabolized to estrogens in placenta.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the sulfotransferase 1 family.{ECO:0000305}. COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_HPRD_00502_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://identifiers.org/refseq/NP_003158</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_rcsb_pdb_1OV4_see-also</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://biocyc.org/biopax/biopax-level3ProteinReference89460</bp:comment>
</bp:ProteinReference>

